### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create Flight Transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "flight",
  "external_id": "flight-demo-001",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "occurred_at": "2026-03-11T06:40:00Z",
  "total": 220.00,
  "tax_lines": [
    { "name": "Airport tax", "amount": 15.00 }
  ],
  "fee_lines": [
    { "name": "YQ", "amount": 25.00 }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "origin": "TXL",
    "destination": "LHR",
    "fare": 180.00,
    "coupons": [
      {
        "carrier": "BA",
        "flight_number": "BA982",
        "from": "TXL",
        "to": "LHR",
        "departure": "2026-03-11T07:00:00Z",
        "arrival": "2026-03-11T08:20:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 3. Duplicate External ID (Returns 409 Conflict with existing ID)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "flight",
  "external_id": "flight-demo-001",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "occurred_at": "2026-03-11T06:40:00Z",
  "total": 220.00,
  "tax_lines": [],
  "fee_lines": [],
  "metadata": {
    "origin": "TXL",
    "destination": "LHR",
    "fare": 220.00,
    "coupons": [
      {
        "carrier": "BA",
        "flight_number": "BA982",
        "from": "TXL",
        "to": "LHR",
        "departure": "2026-03-11T07:00:00Z",
        "arrival": "2026-03-11T08:20:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 4. List Transactions (Default Pagination: limit=50, offset=0)
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions?limit=10&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create Hotel Transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "hotel",
  "external_id": "hotel-demo-001",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "occurred_at": "2026-03-11T15:00:00Z",
  "total": 331.70,
  "tax_lines": [
    { "name": "VAT", "rate": 0.07, "amount": 21.70 }
  ],
  "fee_lines": [],
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Hotel Mitte London",
    "address": {
      "street": "12 Kingsway",
      "city": "London",
      "country": "GB"
    },
    "check_in": "2026-03-11",
    "check_out": "2026-03-13",
    "nights": 2,
    "room_rate_per_night": 140.00,
    "extras": [
      { "name": "Breakfast", "amount": 30.00 }
    ]
  }
}

### 6. Create Trip Fee Transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "navan_fee",
  "external_id": "fee-demo-001",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "occurred_at": "2026-03-11T06:40:00Z",
  "total": 25.00,
  "tax_lines": [],
  "fee_lines": [],
  "metadata": {
    "fee_kind": "trip_fee",
    "description": "Trip booking fee",
    "related_external_id": "flight-demo-001"
  }
}

### 7. Create Invoice from Transactions
# Replace transaction IDs below with IDs returned in steps above
POST http://localhost:8080/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_ids": [
    "YOUR_FLIGHT_ID_HERE"
  ]
}

### 8. Attempt Mutation of Invoiced Transaction (Returns 409 Conflict)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/transactions/YOUR_FLIGHT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "total": 999.00
}

### 9. Attempt Deletion of Invoiced Transaction (Returns 409 Conflict)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transactions/YOUR_FLIGHT_ID_HERE
